<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pemeriksaan Mikrobiologi — Traktus Digestivus</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f5f0eb;
    --bg2: #ede8e1;
    --bg3: #e4ddd4;
    --card: #faf7f4;
    --card2: #f0ece6;
    --text: #2c2825;
    --text2: #5c5550;
    --text3: #8a8280;
    --accent: #7c6f64;
    --accent2: #a8937e;
    --gold: #b8975a;
    --gold2: #d4b07a;
    --grey: #9e9890;
    --border: #d4ccc4;
    --border2: #c8bfb5;
    --highlight: #e8ddd0;
    --red: #c0614a;
    --green: #5a8a6a;
    --blue: #4a6a8a;
    --purple: #7a5a8a;
    --shadow: rgba(44,40,37,0.08);
    --shadow2: rgba(44,40,37,0.15);
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  .hero {
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    padding: 64px 40px 56px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 50%, rgba(184,151,90,0.18) 0%, transparent 65%);
  }
  .hero-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; }
  .hero-tag {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold2);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .hero-tag::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 32px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold2); }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold2); }
  .hero-sub {
    color: rgba(245,240,235,0.65);
    font-size: 15px;
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .hero-meta {
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .hero-stat-num {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--gold2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .hero-stat-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245,240,235,0.5);
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  .toc-wrapper {
    background: var(--card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px var(--shadow);
  }
  .toc {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .toc::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .toc a {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text3);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .toc a:hover { color: var(--accent); border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }
  .toc a.active { color: var(--text); border-bottom-color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── MAIN LAYOUT ── */
  main { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 40px; }

  /* ── SECTIONS ── */
  .section { margin-bottom: 72px; }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .section-num {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  /* ── CARDS ── */
  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .card:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--shadow2); }
  .card-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .card-title .tag {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--bg3);
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  .tag.jamur { background: #e8f0e0; color: #4a7040; }
  .tag.bakteri { background: #e0eaf0; color: #3a5f7a; }
  .tag.flora-normal { background: #f0e8e0; color: #7a5030; }

  /* ── HIGHLIGHT BOXES ── */
  .highlight-box {
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    border-left: 3px solid;
  }
  .highlight-box.gold {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212,176,122,0.1), rgba(184,151,90,0.06));
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .highlight-box.red {
    background: rgba(192,97,74,0.06);
    border-color: var(--red);
  }
  .highlight-box.green {
    background: rgba(90,138,106,0.08);
    border-color: var(--green);
  }
  .highlight-box.blue {
    background: rgba(74,106,138,0.08);
    border-color: var(--blue);
  }
  .highlight-box.purple {
    background: rgba(122,90,138,0.08);
    border-color: var(--purple);
  }
  .highlight-box .hb-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .highlight-box p, .highlight-box li { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .highlight-box ul { padding-left: 18px; }
  .highlight-box li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

  /* ── KEY POINT ── */
  .key-point {
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .key-point .kp-icon { font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .key-point .kp-body { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .key-point .kp-body strong { color: var(--gold2); }

  /* ── TABLE ── */
  .table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13.5px; }
  thead { background: var(--bg3); }
  thead th {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2);
  }
  tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); transition: background 0.15s; }
  tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: var(--highlight); }
  tbody td { padding: 12px 16px; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.5; }
  .cell-em { font-style: italic; color: var(--text2); }
  .dot { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 5px; }
  .dot.red { background: var(--red); }
  .dot.green { background: var(--green); }
  .dot.blue { background: var(--blue); }
  .dot.black { background: #333; }
  .dot.pink { background: #d47aa0; }
  .dot.yellow { background: #c8a835; }

  /* ── FLOW DIAGRAM ── */
  .flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .flow-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .flow-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 40px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .flow-circle {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .flow-line {
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--border2);
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 20px;
  }
  .flow-content {
    padding: 4px 0 24px 20px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .flow-content h4 {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .flow-content p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text2); }

  /* ── MEDIA GRID ── */
  .media-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .media-card {
    background: var(--card2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .media-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px var(--shadow2); }
  .media-card-color {
    height: 80px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .media-card-body { padding: 14px 16px; }
  .media-card-name {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  .media-card-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .media-card-desc { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.5; }

  /* ── CLINICAL REASONING ── */
  .clinical-case {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .cc-header {
    background: var(--bg3);
    padding: 16px 24px;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .cc-body { padding: 24px; }
  .cc-scenario {
    background: rgba(184,151,90,0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .cc-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .cc-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .cc-step-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--bg3);
  }
  .cc-step-text { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; padding-top: 4px; }
  .cc-step-text strong { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── QUIZ ── */
  #quiz-section .section-title { color: var(--text); }
  .quiz-header {
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .quiz-header-icon { font-size: 36px; }
  .quiz-header h3 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .quiz-header p { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(245,240,235,0.6); }
  .quiz-progress-bar {
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 99px;
    height: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .quiz-progress-fill {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--gold2));
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 99px;
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
    width: 0%;
  }
  .quiz-progress-text {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text3);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .quiz-question-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: none;
    animation: fadeSlide 0.35s ease;
  }
  .quiz-question-card.active { display: block; }
  @keyframes fadeSlide {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .quiz-q-num {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .quiz-q-text {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .quiz-options { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .quiz-option {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 13px 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    position: relative;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .quiz-option:hover:not(.disabled) {
    background: var(--highlight);
    border-color: var(--gold);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .quiz-option.selected-correct {
    background: rgba(90,138,106,0.12);
    border-color: var(--green);
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .quiz-option.selected-wrong {
    background: rgba(192,97,74,0.10);
    border-color: var(--red);
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .quiz-option.reveal-correct {
    background: rgba(90,138,106,0.08);
    border-color: var(--green);
    color: var(--green);
  }
  .quiz-option.disabled { cursor: not-allowed; }
  .quiz-feedback {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: none;
  }
  .quiz-feedback.correct {
    background: rgba(90,138,106,0.1);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
    color: var(--text);
    display: block;
  }
  .quiz-feedback.wrong {
    background: rgba(192,97,74,0.08);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--red);
    color: var(--text);
    display: block;
  }
  .quiz-nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .btn {
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }
  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border2);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--highlight); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .quiz-result {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 40px 32px;
    text-align: center;
    display: none;
  }
  .quiz-result.show { display: block; animation: fadeSlide 0.4s ease; }
  .result-score {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .result-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text3);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .result-msg {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .result-sub { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .result-breakdown {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .rb-item { text-align: center; }
  .rb-num { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; }
  .rb-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); }

  /* ── MISC ── */
  .two-col { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  .pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .pill.gold { background: rgba(184,151,90,0.15); color: var(--gold); }
  .pill.red { background: rgba(192,97,74,0.12); color: var(--red); }
  .pill.green { background: rgba(90,138,106,0.12); color: var(--green); }
  ul.styled { padding-left: 0; list-style: none; }
  ul.styled li {
    padding: 6px 0 6px 22px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  ul.styled li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  ul.styled li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .khas-badge {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold2));
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 32px 0;
  }
  .back-to-top {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 28px;
    right: 28px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--shadow2);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .back-to-top.visible { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; }
  .back-to-top:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero { padding: 40px 24px; }
    main { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .toc { padding: 0 24px; }
    .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .card { padding: 20px; }
    .media-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-tag">Blok Digestivus · Mikrobiologi Klinik</div>
    <h1>Pemeriksaan <em>Mikrobiologi</em><br>Infeksi Traktus Digestivus</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Rangkuman komprehensif pendekatan diagnostik mikrobologi, clinical reasoning, dan media kultur untuk patogen saluran cerna.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-num">4</span><span class="hero-stat-label">Patogen Utama</span></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-num">6</span><span class="hero-stat-label">Media Kultur</span></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-num">3</span><span class="hero-stat-label">Kasus Klinis</span></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-num">12</span><span class="hero-stat-label">Soal Quiz</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- NAV -->
<div class="toc-wrapper">
  <nav class="toc">
    <a href="#pendahuluan">📖 Pendahuluan</a>
    <a href="#alur-diagnosis">🔬 Alur Diagnosis</a>
    <a href="#candida">🍄 Candida</a>
    <a href="#helicobacter">🦠 H. pylori</a>
    <a href="#ecoli">🧫 E. coli</a>
    <a href="#salmonella">🧪 Salmonella</a>
    <a href="#tabel-perbandingan">📊 Perbandingan</a>
